      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JOCK ROCK (6) made an encouraging debut last time out, racing on speed and was just edged out over 1350m at this track. Back in trip but has upside and looks sure to measure up. FLYING FURTHER (7) debuted two weeks ago when she finished fourth over 1150m at this track, beaten 2.5 lengths. Likely improver and worth following up. OUT OF THE SPHERE (2) was prominent at the turn and finished third last time over 1009m at this track when resuming from a spell, beaten 1.1 lengths. Fitter and is a leading contender. AWESOME ORPHAN (4) was beaten 4.5 lengths into fifth in a 1350m contest at this track a week ago. Quick back-up and won't be far away. BLUE RENDEZVOUS (5) is a mare by Blue Point making her first appearance. Runner-up in a Devonport Synthetic trial over 800m on September 1. Profiles well and a bold run is expected.",
